# Paths Semgrep does not scan (see the semgrep job in .github/workflows/checks.yml).
# This file REPLACES Semgrep's built-in default exclusions, so the usual virtualenv and build
# directories are restated here; .gitignore is honoured separately. Test suites are not
# shipped, and their fixtures are exactly what the rules exist to flag in real code. The R
# package is not listed because Semgrep has no R support; lintr and R CMD check cover it.
.git/
.venv/
**/__pycache__/
dist/
tests/
r/.Rproj.user/
